WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:04.151
CAPSULE: Meet the PopPK and AI Methodology Atlas.

00:00:04.151 --> 00:00:07.324
CAPSULE: A focused reading queue for pharmacometrics

00:00:07.324 --> 00:00:08.910
CAPSULE: and artificial intelligence.

00:00:09.260 --> 00:00:11.633
TABLET: It searches daily. No new match?

00:00:11.633 --> 00:00:14.401
TABLET: Discover an unreported paper from 2020 onward.

00:00:14.751 --> 00:00:18.386
CAPSULE: Each brief covers the problem, contribution,

00:00:18.386 --> 00:00:20.810
CAPSULE: new possibilities, and significance.

00:00:20.810 --> 00:00:23.233
CAPSULE: Interpretations use abstracts only.

00:00:23.583 --> 00:00:25.445
TABLET: Search, filter, and compare.

00:00:25.445 --> 00:00:28.703
TABLET: Relevance measures topic fit, not scientific quality.

00:00:29.053 --> 00:00:32.386
CAPSULE: Every selected paper is saved in the library.

00:00:32.386 --> 00:00:35.302
CAPSULE: GitHub notifications, daily reports, and the website

00:00:35.302 --> 00:00:38.218
CAPSULE: keep your reading queue up to date.

00:00:38.568 --> 00:00:39.647
TABLET: Read. Compare. Verify.

00:00:39.647 --> 00:00:42.164
TABLET: Open the Atlas, find your next paper,

00:00:42.164 --> 00:00:43.602
TABLET: and explore the method.
